# ─── Local-only guides & scripts (kept on your laptop, never pushed) ───
# Leading "/" = only the file in the project ROOT. Without it Git ignores the name in
# every folder (that used to hide docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md, which IS part of the repo).
/CODEBASE_EXPLAINER.md
/CODEBASE_EXPLAINER_OLD.md
/AGENT_BRIEF.md
/DEV_SETUP_PHONE_AND_EMULATOR.md
/DISTRIBUTE_*.md
/dev-both.ps1
/install-dev-apk.ps1
# Hand-off notes that come with update zips
/PASTE_GUIDE.md
/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.md
/AUTO_LOGGING_EXPLAINED.md
/PROJECT_EXPLAINED.md
# Old local copies (safe to delete; kept ignored in case they still exist)
/MANUAL_STEPS.md
/RELEASE_PROCESS.md
/docs/AGENT_BRIEF.md
